+| OS | Previous → new | Offered without a channel switch | Installed and relaunched; About shows the new version; no "update did not apply" | Sessions, settings, keychain items, CLI shim intact | Outcome |
+|---|---|---|---|---|---|
+| macOS | `<> → <>` | `<>` | `<>` | `<>` | `<>` |
+| Windows | `<> → <>` | `<>` | `<>` | `<>` | `<>` |
